 LAST raised alarm of that severity is cleared.]]></Comment><BitSize>43008</BitSize><SubItem><Name>nStationId</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ 1..GVL_Params.cStations - set before the first call]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bInitialized</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>96</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>hrLastError</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ last failed call (latched)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>aRaised</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>8</Elements></ArrayInfo><Comment><![CDATA[ live state of this station's own alarms]]></Comment><BitSize>64</BitSize><BitOffs>160</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>nRaised</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ how many of them are raised]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>224</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbSource</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_EventLogger">FB_TcSourceInfo</Type><BitSize>3072</BitSize><BitOffs>256</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>fbMessage</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_EventLogger">FB_TcMessage</Type><BitSize>4288</BitSize><BitOffs>3328</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>aAlarms</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_EventLogger">FB_TcAlarm</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>8</Elements></ArrayInfo><BitSize>33792</BitSize><BitOffs>7616</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>aAlarmDefs</Name><Type GUID="{6925E8D1-EDCA-47DD-B80C-A6329A85D63D}">TcEventEntry</Type><Arr