or (second character) ]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><Default><Value>10</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">EMPTY_GUID_STRUCT</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000021}">GUID</Type><BitSize>128</BitSize><Default><SubItem><Name>.Data1</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data2</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data3</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[0]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[1]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[2]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[3]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[4]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[5]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[6]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem><SubItem><Name>.Data4[7]</Name><Value>0</Value></SubItem></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">EMPTY_GUID_STRING</Name><Type>STRING(36)</Type><BitSize>296</BitSize><Default><String>00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000</String></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">EMPTY_GUID_REGSTRING</Name><Type>STRING(38)</Type><BitSize>312</BitSize><Default><String>{00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000}</String></Default></SubItem></DataType><DataType><Name>TC_EVENTS</Name><Properties><Property><Name>TcTypeSystem</Name></Property><Property><Name>global_init_slot</Name><Value>10003</Value></Property><Property><Name>update_if_necessary</Name></Property><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property><Property><Name>TC_EVENTS</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>MAIN</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Test harness: 12 stations publish events, ONE listener keeps the active alarm
 list and drives 12 stack lights - all in the PLC, no HMI involved.

 How to play (online, in the declaration part of MAIN):
   1. set nTestStation (1..12) and nTestAlarm (1..8, see FB_Station header for the mapping)
   2. pulse bTestRaise / bTestClear / bTestSendMessage
   3. watch aActiveAlarms, aRecentMessages, aStackLights[n].bRed/bYellow/bGreen]]></Comment><SubItem><Name Static="true">bSubscribe</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize><Default><Bool>true</Bool></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">bTestRaise</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ raise aAlarms[nTestAlarm] on station nTestStation]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">bTestClear</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ clear it again]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">hrSubscribe</Name><Type GUID="{18071995-0000-0000-0000-000000000019}">HRESULT</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">aStations</Name><Type>FB_Station</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>12</Elements></ArrayInfo><Comment><![CDATA[ event publishers (app specific)]]></Comment><BitSize>516096</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">aStackLights</Name><Type>FB_StackLight</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>12</Elements></ArrayInfo><Comment><![CDATA[ decoder ring -> outputs (app specific)]]></Comment><BitSize>44544</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">fbListener</Name><Type>FB_ActiveAlarmListener</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ the generic "active alarm list" (one per PLC) + the storage it works on (sized here, by the application)]]></Comment><BitSize>3904</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">aActiveAlarms</Name><Type>ST_EventListEntry</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>128</Elements></ArrayInfo><Comment><![CDATA[ raised alarms]]></Comment><BitSize>352256</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">aRecentMessages</Name><Type>ST_EventListEntry</Type><ArrayInfo><LBound>1</LBound><Elements>32</Elements></ArrayInfo><Comment><![CDATA[ last 32 messages (ring buffer)]]></Comment><BitSize>88064</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">fbFilter</Name><Type Namespace="Tc3_EventLogger">FB_TcEventFilter</Type><BitSize>11776</BitSize></SubItem>